The Champion of Casterwill fought alongside Lord Casterwill and his children in the war against the [[Nullifiers]]. {{source|Sophie on Trial}}

The Champion was present when Lord Casterwill used the [[Willblade]] to seal the [[Spiral Mark]], and ensured that there was no one else about. {{source|The Spiral Mark}}

In the [[Fortress of Iron Will]], [[Sophie Casterwill]] translated an ancient door to the vault of [[Mythras]] as only being accessible to the Champion of Casterwill. However, the door eventually opened to the power of [[Lok Lambert]] from the [[Willblade]]. {{source|Sophie on Trial}}

[[The Betrayer]] had [[Demigorgan]], the Legendary Titan of Betrayal, use the Champion's image as a means of defeating [[Pendragon|Powerbonded Pendragon]] whilst fighting [[Lok Lambert]]. {{source|Dante's Return}}
